## Workers project — no .env, config lives in wrangler.jsonc + secrets.
##
## Local dev secret (create .dev.vars, gitignored):
##   BARBMAN_TOKEN=dev-secret-token
##
## Prod secret (never in a file, set via CLI):
##   wrangler secret put BARBMAN_TOKEN
##
## Public vars (already in wrangler.jsonc):
##   CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://onbarber.com.py,http://localhost:4321
